{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.440000534057617,"text":"Marble slabs carved with coats of arms—lions, crosses, birds, stripes—every coat of arms works like a family badge, and because the knights came from all over Europe, the slabs read like a map—French names, Spanish, Italian, English. The order was divided into groups according to the language each man spoke, and every group had a house of its own on the Street of the Knights, a few meters up the hill.","words":[{"word":"Marble","start":0,"end":0.8199999928474426},{"word":"slabs","start":0.8199999928474426,"end":1.3799999952316284},{"word":"carved","start":1.3799999952316284,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"with","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"coats","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.440000057220459},{"word":"of","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.819999933242798},{"word":"arms—lions","start":2.819999933242798,"end":4.179999828338623},{"word":"crosses","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"birds","start":5.880000114440918,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"stripes—every","start":6.639999866485596,"end":7.639999866485596},{"word":"coat","start":7.639999866485596,"end":7.920000076293945},{"word":"of","start":7.920000076293945,"end":8.479999542236328},{"word":"arms","start":8.479999542236328,"end":8.479999542236328},{"word":"works","start":8.479999542236328,"end":8.720000267028809},{"word":"like","start":8.720000267028809,"end":8.979999542236328},{"word":"a","start":8.979999542236328,"end":9.300000190734863},{"word":"family","start":9.300000190734863,"end":9.460000038146973},{"word":"badge","start":9.460000038146973,"end":9.880000114440918},{"word":"and","start":10.0600004196167,"end":10.4399995803833},{"word":"because","start":10.4399995803833,"end":10.760000228881836},{"word":"the","start":10.760000228881836,"end":11.239999771118164},{"word":"knights","start":11.239999771118164,"end":11.239999771118164},{"word":"came","start":11.239999771